flowchart TD
    A[Player enters BoxCollision] --> B[OnBoxOverlap]
    B --> C[Player->AssignBuildable this]
    D[Player presses E] --> E{Buildable valid?}
    E -->|No| F[return]
    E -->|Yes| G[SpawnActor with FTransform]
    G --> H{Gold >= GetCost?}
    H -->|No| I[Destroy tower, return]
    H -->|Yes| J[SpendGold]
    J --> K[SetIsOccupied true]
    K --> L[Buildable = nullptr]
